      "content": "hey, i'm working on a backgrounder piece about the Inflation Reduction Act and the climate provisions specifically. can you give me a breakdown of the main points of contention people are arguing about? also, i need to know how much validity there is to the concerns raised by the critics regarding energy costs and grid stability vs the arguments from the supporters.",
